Notes for VS Code

# In order to resolve the "Import "pygame.locals" could not be resolved" error
    1-You need to select the correct pthon interpreter (VS Code) 
    2-Open command palette with ctrl-shift-P
    3-type and select "python: Slect interpreter"
    4-Choose the interpreter located inside your venv folder
    5-Wait a few seconds for the editor (Pylance) to re-scan the environment and clear the error
    